{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53442","headline":"答问附歌 · 柳宗元","name":"答问附歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尧舜之修兮，禹益之忧兮，能者任而愚者休兮。\n蹮蹮蓬藋，乐吾（一作「夫」）囚兮，文墨之彬彬（一本作「申申」），足以申吾愁兮。\n已乎已乎，曷之求乎！（见《柳河东集》卷十五）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53442.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53442","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}